      "writtenOn": "2021-10-08T22:14:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this needed if the paint doesn\u0027t have local coordinates?\n\nWe should avoid special handling eventually if the paint doesn\u0027t have local coords, but I\u0027m wondering if the right spot to do that is here or further down the stack.",
